id=shark8-smartrefresh
name=Shark8 SmartRefresh
version=1.7
versionCode=8
author=jan
description=Fix screen tearing by keeping the MTK display low-power path out of the vblank path (mtk_drm_idlemgr no longer cycles drm_crtc_vblank_off while the HWC is waiting), and replace MTK dynamic FPS with a clean touch-driven 60/120 Hz governor. No drm_crtc_vblank churn, no waitNextVsync EINVAL bursts.
